          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Anatomical design</span></span></p>\n<p>Case is planned using patient-specific CT data. Allowing for the ability&nbsp;to visualize anatomical landmarks and ensure surgical plan matches patient's anatomy.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 04 2025 20:12:01 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "topPadding": "5",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Design session</span></span></p>\n<p>Web-based design session allowing a surgeon direct input on every step of the pre-surgical plan.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 04 2025 20:12:17 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "topPadding": "5",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Surgical splints</span></span></p>\n<p>Surgical splints help transfer the pre-surgical plan into the operating room, helping to&nbsp;ensure accuracy.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 04 2025 20:12:33 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
